                                "sense_id": "407630d3-1e97-346b-b581-7f0c3abcba31",
                                "text": "Stationed just outside the main gate, the band is hammering away at ‘Rule Britannia’ and the bourrée from the ‘Royal Fireworks Music.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
